  Note that this is a random feature of the dungeon.  A closet off of a
room with no door (secret or otherwise), containing a scroll of
teleport.  They're interesting to find with spell/scroll of magic
mapping or spell/cornuthaum/AmuletOfYendor clairvoyance.  (Spell of
detect treasure or potion of object detection will show the scroll.)

  Sometimes the closet opens onto a corridor (due to the vagaries of
corridor generation), but not always.  They're a nice source of
teleportation scrolls as well as being a way to identify teleportation
scrolls.


